    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Class generated from source table 'products'.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A product available for sale.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A product in the Northwind catalogue. Each product is supplied by one supplier and belongs to one category. This class holds current inventory, pricing, and reorder information for each product.</rdfs:comment>
