    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Categories</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A product category grouping similar food or beverage products (e.g. Beverages, Condiments, Seafood).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Class generated from source table 'categories'.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A product category used by Northwind Traders to group specialty food and beverage products for catalogue browsing and reporting. Examples include Beverages, Condiments, Confections, Dairy Products, and Seafood. Each product belongs to exactly one category.</rdfs:comment>
